{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他一想起那种亲近安稳的日子，心里刚松下来，眼前没解决的事也跟着冒出来。\",\n      \"key\": \"安稳的日子\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕再一股劲往前又把自己逼垮，原先那股决心已不能让他放心照做。\",\n      \"key\": \"逼垮\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他把舍不得的日子和眼前那些让它难以实现的事放在一起想。\",\n      \"key\": \"放在一起想\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他暂时还想不出怎么两边都顾到，也没再逼自己立刻丢掉一边。\",\n      \"key\": \"丢掉一边\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B3\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"失效\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R45\",\n        \"R46\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S10-1\",\n        \"S10-2\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把看清愿望却不能立刻勇敢、两条路都有难处的抽象概括，改成此刻具体的阻滞：旧愿带来安慰时，未解决的事也会回来；他怕照旧用力又把自己逼垮。回指旧愿曾带来的安稳、行动曾造成的疲惫和原有动力的失效，保留认识与行动之间的距离。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R47\",\n        \"R48\",\n        \"R49\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S10-3\",\n        \"S10-4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去整齐的条件式行动准则和反复想着愿望的重复内容，改成他把向往的日子与妨碍它实现的事放在一起想。保留他暂时想不出办法的事实，并让非此即彼的逼迫从这个具体思考中松动，而不是直接宣布认知转变。原先没力气要求自己大变的意思，改成暂不逼自己立即取舍，更具体地呈现当下的限度。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2ac355d5-a21c-496e-966d-57f9e05e7f60", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T092721393589Z", "elapsed_seconds": 993.844, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T09:43:55.243777+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f5617c3f93957a63d3ac19aaa092bd04760ca4e2c73a3ac17d1de44785ecdbb0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-202